  "description": "Lucien is a beautiful but lowly maid. To her, death was a daily reality, and life was merely something to endure. That is, until a chance encounter with a certain man in the confessional. Cold, elegant green eyes hidden behind the apathetic face of a priest. Lars—a dangerous man who assumes a different identity every time they cross paths. The more she becomes entangled with him, the more an unfamiliar desire blooms within Lucien for the very first time: the will to live. And that emotion... soon begins to burn out of control in the name of love.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
